                "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">(not a full review)</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I think the important part of this issue is to find cases where <code class=\"notranslate\">self</code> (as a concept, not as a name) is really missing from the func definition.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So, we can clearly tell apart cases where we just forgot a parameter vs where we forgot to add <code class=\"notranslate\">self</code> to the function definition.</p>",
